      "content": "hey so im planning a documentary trip through the caucasus region next month. basically need to navigate the political landscape so i dont get caught in the middle of anything. from a safety perspective, which political groups or factions should i look for if i want to talk to 'moderate' people, and which ones are generally considered too radical or unstable to interact with?",
